                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL DE CODAGE DE SIGNAL AINSI QUE PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL DE DÉCODAGE DE SIGNAL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SIGNAL ENCODING METHOD AND APPARATUS AND SIGNAL DECODING METHOD AND APPARATUS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A spectrum coding method includes quantizing spectral data of a current band based on a first quantization scheme, generating a lower bit of the current band using the spectral data and the quantized spectral data, quantizing a sequence of lower bits including the lower bit of the current band based on a second quantization scheme, and generating a bitstream based on a upper bit excluding N bits, where N is 1 or greater, from the quantized spectral data and the quantized sequence of lower bits.</p>
            </abstract>
